@meeting introAsk
// Tap Zeke Torres on Day 0, before 'free' (head writer 3, 0.48.22; the onboarding engineer's hook, which needs a
// one-line tap hook in section 10). Replays each time you ask. Three questions (meetings take three replies at most);
// how a ship day runs is told at dinner (introDinner). No scarf, no father, no Engine Specialist list.
title: Ask Zeke
from: Zeke Torres
gist: You asked Zeke Torres about himself, Works and where the Wren is going.
== lines
torres-zeke > you: Go on, ask. Questions are the best bit.   [nod]
? choice
* Who are you, then?   flavour:listen
  torres-zeke: Zeke. Engine officer, days. I mind the drive coils on Deck 6. And I'm your trainer this week. I talk a lot.   [laugh]
* What does Works do?   flavour:practical
  torres-zeke: Keeps her running. Air, water, lights, the lift, the engines. Faults go on the board; we fix them properly.   [gesture]
* Where's the ship going?   flavour:share
  torres-zeke: Out along the frontier, mapping. Survey picks the stars; we get her there. The Veyli share it. Their Envoy's aboard.   [nod]
torres-zeke: Anything else, just tap me. Right, onward.
